ama bin Carlyle Group err you know what I mean to illustrate what a bravo sierra farce the war on terrorism is. The neo-feudal corporate scientific dictatorship is in high gear and people who are not awake now are probably goners. Kissinger is on record as saying anyone who opposes globalism is a terrorist. &lt;BR/&gt;The real war is on any knee that won&#39;t bend whether it&#39;s christian polygamists, people who know too much about the constitution, horn rimmed glasses wearing pc geeks on laptops reading and commenting on blogs or those pesky islamofascists who won&#39;t kiss the posterior of the IMF and world bank and have strict religious code against usary and interest. I owe my finely tuned tyrannist bravo sierra detector to my Scottish grandmother and her well stocked library many an hour was spent reading Plato, Eric Blair Orwell, Huxley and insider studies of nazi Germany. Part of the problem with the unawakened is the only reading material in the house is the telephone book or a tv guide.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/5980763611142996508/comments/default/6144505361132684412'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/5980763611142996508/comments/default/6144505361132684412'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2008/04/collectivist-child-abuse.html?showComment=1208661180000#c6144505361132684412' title=''/><author><name>captain obvious</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2008/04/collectivist-child-abuse.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-5980763611142996508' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/5980763611142996508